db/id "q-113486" :question/id #uuid "22b9e6d8-eac2-556d-ac94-c171a6cadf5b" :question/math-academy-id "q-113486" :question/problem "$\\int 48(3x-2)^{7}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3x-2.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 48(3x-2)^{7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 48{u}^{7}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =48\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}\\int {u}^{7}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =16\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{8}}{8}+C \\\\  & =2\\cdot {u}^{8}+C \\\\  & =2(3x-2)^{8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[2(3x-2)^{8}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[2(3x-2)^{8}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =16(3x-2)^{7}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3x-2)+0 \\\\  & =16(3x-2)^{7}\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =48(3x-2)^{7}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-113486/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e2b47545-fdf1-5e6a-b0bb-bbbecb8067cc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113486"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502/selection/5d7255b1e6d0ed12751dd0eb1f28e93112ef78b006a3e44c8c5c4d27e8897f24" :answer/id #uuid "fe3ec2dc-930d-55df-af4b-c9b66f693e80" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{5}(2-5x)^{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502/selection/0a193d250e974687a3d07c190e91ec5e709e0b3361e7f508e79d731cb4fd27b5" :answer/id #uuid "0f7d115a-40e8-5f9b-86f2-f85333b421fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5}(2-5x)^{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502/selection/0782ac8d667d956fe0ee1d6f323d66fcdaa32119b1cf285f31f497d2b2f57132" :answer/id #uuid "5fc0a28b-c5be-5508-9691-bd75643d1f19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{18}{5}(2-5x)^{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502/selection/862a60fa21b17f3de998a3ab1413d0bbb8b7f8af32d4495ac7c7a59c39236638" :answer/id #uuid "82ef7604-8d9b-5eff-927e-b5ec9885b885" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{18}{5}(2-5x)^{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502/selection/ddc30c9cd25aa4c83dd80fbffa268bafec24e6eac8403d004741b24a5813fe37" :answer/id #uuid "c657b13e-8cc1-5158-8fc3-8bc37dd730b0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{15}(2-5x)^{6}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "be7ae9cd-355c-58e2-9264-80aa13dd39aa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113502/selection/0a193d250e974687a3d07c190e91ec5e709e0b3361e7f508e79d731cb4fd27b5" :answer-field/choices ["q-113502/selection/5d7255b1e6d0ed12751dd0eb1f28e93112ef78b006a3e44c8c5c4d27e8897f24" "q-113502/selection/0a193d250e974687a3d07c190e91ec5e709e0b3361e7f508e79d731cb4fd27b5" "q-113502/selection/0782ac8d667d956fe0ee1d6f323d66fcdaa32119b1cf285f31f497d2b2f57132" "q-113502/selection/862a60fa21b17f3de998a3ab1413d0bbb8b7f8af32d4495ac7c7a59c39236638" "q-113502/selection/ddc30c9cd25aa4c83dd80fbffa268bafec24e6eac8403d004741b24a5813fe37"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113502" :question/id #uuid "201b1303-edfe-5a94-b70a-3687fd03d284" :question/math-academy-id "q-113502" :question/problem "$\\int 18(2-5x)^{5}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2-5x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 18(2-5x)^{5}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 18{u}^{5}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5})\\text{d}u \\\\  & =18\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5})\\int {u}^{5}\\cdot \\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{18}{5}\\int {u}^{5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{18}{5}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{6}}{6}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}{u}^{6}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}(2-5x)^{6}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{3}{5}(2-5x)^{6}+C] & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{3}{5}(2-5x)^{6}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{18}{5}(2-5x)^{5}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2-5x)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{18}{5}(2-5x)^{5}\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =18(2-5x)^{5}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-113502/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e2b47545-fdf1-5e6a-b0bb-bbbecb8067cc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113502"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492/selection/e6682004d63e14487f3751e4ec3123f8e1006b24e7c4f47d974af07ff1f0b0b1" :answer/id #uuid "99ff9bea-f0a9-53cd-9159-90d8055b76a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6(5-3x)^{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492/selection/55740615138c421b81fb8631ac90f3853996764b5297ff239290c9b5256f7848" :answer/id #uuid "a5c0e2fa-95ab-521c-827b-53bf52dcdf1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}(5-3x)^{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492/selection/03bba0f8ca6553a257c1d2a23c09c85a70f7b41c30beaf96ebfcf85afeed2fca" :answer/id #uuid "c0e08971-039c-5916-9b12-85d583d48e5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{3}(5-3x)^{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492/selection/1012316096e17de57e7c9af088bee6df4e8bf4fed9a502731d3a853acdfac4f4" :answer/id #uuid "be58e587-aea9-560e-9a13-cf2848d5db72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{3}(5-3x)^{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492/selection/8fc1e6d8114c9dcbe6f0302a846d307a32d703c6f31f79efe426ffc1d0f409b6" :answer/id #uuid "07cdebcb-6b52-5c0a-ba32-ef0c743f45ad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2(5-3x)^{3}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "820a10db-076d-5b88-a7eb-c533067ddf9d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113492/selection/1012316096e17de57e7c9af088bee6df4e8bf4fed9a502731d3a853acdfac4f4" :answer-field/choices ["q-113492/selection/e6682004d63e14487f3751e4ec3123f8e1006b24e7c4f47d974af07ff1f0b0b1" "q-113492/selection/55740615138c421b81fb8631ac90f3853996764b5297ff239290c9b5256f7848" "q-113492/selection/03bba0f8ca6553a257c1d2a23c09c85a70f7b41c30beaf96ebfcf85afeed2fca" "q-113492/selection/1012316096e17de57e7c9af088bee6df4e8bf4fed9a502731d3a853acdfac4f4" "q-113492/selection/8fc1e6d8114c9dcbe6f0302a846d307a32d703c6f31f79efe426ffc1d0f409b6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113492" :question/id #uuid "6477ece7-72c1-5377-8b6c-83eda134c6c1" :question/math-academy-id "q-113492" :question/problem "$\\int 6(5-3x)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=5-3x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-3\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{3}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 6(5-3x)^{2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 6{u}^{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =6\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{3})\\int {u}^{2}\\cdot \\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-2\\int {u}^{2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-2\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{3}}{3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{3}(5-3x)^{3}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{2}{3}(5-3x)^{3}+C] & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{2}{3}(5-3x)^{3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-2(5-3x)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5-3x)+0 \\\\  & =-2(5-3x)^{2}\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =6(5-3x)^{2}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-113492/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e2b47545-fdf1-5e6a-b0bb-bbbecb8067cc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113492"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424/selection/de9f392d1940f7db3083b0fe123bd5dc60da2632316f2d04d563ccd6728ff4ca" :answer/id #uuid "505cc434-c74e-5dc4-8e46-3477df12efd3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{8}(7-2x)^{8}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424/selection/7529b7133782017e05b48223dfcc8144183a9209d0523b2879f2e66d86c3a9f9" :answer/id #uuid "805518e3-d5f7-5f73-8953-259d06975795" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(7-2x)^{8}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424/selection/ebde65345d79b2dfdff9a01b83d42555a1df95902af4433ec5edb5a8c4fab2d5" :answer/id #uuid "5a9db785-6fbb-5738-b4e8-df9a63e710a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(7-2x)^{8}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424/selection/249ea44cb4cacbb3b17fab795934c30f760ba3239a91f6479b8a6943eba80464" :answer/id #uuid "2fa9061c-018a-502b-8f17-0c8208d11c99" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}(7-2x)^{8}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424/selection/1ff9a5e93a9ba9ced3e62c1051de16084073dc64c3f9eceb5b64571c2b31b0ab" :answer/id #uuid "3f8ec8ec-677b-58b6-ae42-62ec81f9bfe3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-(7-2x)^{8}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "f56c58ed-d97c-51ce-a838-cbc7115d5792" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72424/selection/1ff9a5e93a9ba9ced3e62c1051de16084073dc64c3f9eceb5b64571c2b31b0ab" :answer-field/choices ["q-72424/selection/de9f392d1940f7db3083b0fe123bd5dc60da2632316f2d04d563ccd6728ff4ca" "q-72424/selection/7529b7133782017e05b48223dfcc8144183a9209d0523b2879f2e66d86c3a9f9" "q-72424/selection/ebde65345d79b2dfdff9a01b83d42555a1df95902af4433ec5edb5a8c4fab2d5" "q-72424/selection/249ea44cb4cacbb3b17fab795934c30f760ba3239a91f6479b8a6943eba80464" "q-72424/selection/1ff9a5e93a9ba9ced3e62c1051de16084073dc64c3f9eceb5b64571c2b31b0ab"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72424" :question/id #uuid "8c75bb9c-44e2-5f73-9a68-3c296ae237a7" :question/math-academy-id "q-72424" :question/problem "$\\int 16(7-2x)^{7}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=7-2x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 16(7-2x)^{7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 16{u}^{7}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =16\\int {u}^{7}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =16\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\int {u}^{7}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-8\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{8}}{8}+C \\\\  & =-{u}^{8}+C \\\\  & =-(7-2x)^{8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-(7-2x)^{8}+C] & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(7-2x)^{8}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-8(7-2x)^{7}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7-2x)+0 \\\\  & =-8(7-2x)^{7}\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =16(7-2x)^{7}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72424/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e2b47545-fdf1-5e6a-b0bb-bbbecb8067cc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72424"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503/selection/79e5c943ecbb12ce01d42b536351efd369a60693718620d44a5af3480bb68ee5" :answer/id #uuid "8a1a0e75-0f67-5010-97f4-32d472064a34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{9}{2}(3-2x)^{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503/selection/4f8a26c4accc65f4381856dc0dcb31fcbc76aa851e57cacfc7daeb65f795f736" :answer/id #uuid "4eab4ba4-33d5-5950-a676-292915b674f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9(3-2x)^{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503/selection/6b7572c28aa112e46606e67e797d516ba239e2f596769c21c37f000f08ff62e2" :answer/id #uuid "05b9fad4-f394-5e53-9c49-8d7637653fbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}(3-2x)^{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503/selection/455d0627f058ddb38e36113eede7d216e8acd106872b823d6588ab9949fa1737" :answer/id #uuid "47227283-f02b-5bb5-baf9-c048655d39d8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{9}{2}(3-2x)^{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503/selection/32e8d8c76132421e2199f02072b899c617c58139de3481a5cf508f4099a36c7a" :answer/id #uuid "4ab3379a-f72a-547a-a712-e7549846f133" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}(3-2x)^{9}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "2445d7bf-bed5-53ac-bf0f-f97b1b775b70" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113503/selection/6b7572c28aa112e46606e67e797d516ba239e2f596769c21c37f000f08ff62e2" :answer-field/choices ["q-113503/selection/79e5c943ecbb12ce01d42b536351efd369a60693718620d44a5af3480bb68ee5" "q-113503/selection/4f8a26c4accc65f4381856dc0dcb31fcbc76aa851e57cacfc7daeb65f795f736" "q-113503/selection/6b7572c28aa112e46606e67e797d516ba239e2f596769c21c37f000f08ff62e2" "q-113503/selection/455d0627f058ddb38e36113eede7d216e8acd106872b823d6588ab9949fa1737" "q-113503/selection/32e8d8c76132421e2199f02072b899c617c58139de3481a5cf508f4099a36c7a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113503" :question/id #uuid "4f3c217a-2c5a-5d18-9a3f-59edcf917f64" :question/math-academy-id "q-113503" :question/problem "$\\int 9(3-2x)^{8}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3-2x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 9(3-2x)^{8}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 9{u}^{8}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\text{d}u \\\\  & =9\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\int {u}^{8}\\cdot \\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}\\int {u}^{8}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{9}}{9}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}{u}^{9}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}(3-2x)^{9}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{2}(3-2x)^{9}+C] & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{2}(3-2x)^{9}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}(3-2x)^{8}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3-2x)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{9}{2}(3-2x)^{8}\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =9(3-2x)^{8}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-113503/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e2b47545-fdf1-5e6a-b0bb-bbbecb8067cc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113503"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509/selection/89be4e31dfe89dd94565fe5047d41cbbb21418a044e9b9171f37281340066dd4" :answer/id #uuid "914cc726-ec03-5e57-9563-65a55e62819c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{(x-2)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509/selection/dda3e580b25e46f679f5ba4d7ba3c62be541b831d1750b9462a6eb0c1a806b31" :answer/id #uuid "fc0fd2d9-a9ef-5a79-99ab-10eb52c2b299" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2(x-2)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509/selection/69c7eef1a5de02bd919c92675a8d47d3bbfaf3de4473ac2bdb8fcd4555069ba3" :answer/id #uuid "3771c00f-af07-53e7-984d-3a753a36e261" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{2}{(x-2)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509/selection/2a75f0c6db199f2c91d99be8720183630df97590f41c9846c1a804683d5c3de2" :answer/id #uuid "4f034061-faaf-5f2d-8012-9766cef6d43a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2(x-2)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509/selection/492c68970b8f243405c9d3410b93d69a061d7c169e720cf482251d9443f3fb5a" :answer/id #uuid "be3470b9-6a83-5045-9e64-0714b5c203e9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2(x-2)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "aabd1db3-f13d-506c-9d3f-3a5bb1d65253" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113509/selection/dda3e580b25e46f679f5ba4d7ba3c62be541b831d1750b9462a6eb0c1a806b31" :answer-field/choices ["q-113509/selection/89be4e31dfe89dd94565fe5047d41cbbb21418a044e9b9171f37281340066dd4" "q-113509/selection/dda3e580b25e46f679f5ba4d7ba3c62be541b831d1750b9462a6eb0c1a806b31" "q-113509/selection/69c7eef1a5de02bd919c92675a8d47d3bbfaf3de4473ac2bdb8fcd4555069ba3" "q-113509/selection/2a75f0c6db199f2c91d99be8720183630df97590f41c9846c1a804683d5c3de2" "q-113509/selection/492c68970b8f243405c9d3410b93d69a061d7c169e720cf482251d9443f3fb5a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113509" :question/id #uuid "1948aa2d-5fbb-59f5-8ccc-6dd9cfd6ef51" :question/math-academy-id "q-113509" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{1}{(x-2)^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (x-2)^{-3}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=x-2.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x-2)^{-3}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{-3}\\cdot \\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {u}^{-2}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2{u}^{2}}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2(x-2)^{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{2(x-2)^{2}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{2(x-2)^{2}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(x-2)^{-2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-2)\\cdot (x-2)^{-3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x-2)+0 \\\\  & =1\\cdot \\frac{1}{(x-2)^{3}}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(x-2)^{3}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-113509/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113509"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431/selection/f00f7fe4bdb5a1ba69e484be68bc584990708b6a8ecf444a91a92bd3c51168ca" :answer/id #uuid "0489fd82-f146-57d2-ab56-a6315be6a3b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{(8-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431/selection/2582eededdce771f69264958a7e9833166b57dd21f6bcfbbb6a702be348acd01" :answer/id #uuid "0a57e3fb-2bf3-565e-8b71-f170fbd5a13f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{(8-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431/selection/5a205519a39aae2cc2ee3ab2b4f40c05710edef1635521291bff72e38d1d7e67" :answer/id #uuid "a7ce7760-15b6-5db1-b09f-6d2f2ccede52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{(8-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431/selection/10deb657ce6245f2c87853d0ba377db6a8c75128c2ca248866674550f0d2e753" :answer/id #uuid "debbb027-6e7f-5907-82a3-fcdf1dfbc424" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{4}{(8-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431/selection/4f9a3f596f38256fa2db08c03e11de561715e67db736d93b6847644322cedbfc" :answer/id #uuid "70b95a79-24f0-56c3-9c4e-41afedf8910b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{(8-x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "dcb36960-42db-5176-ab59-fa02936d8e91" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72431/selection/f00f7fe4bdb5a1ba69e484be68bc584990708b6a8ecf444a91a92bd3c51168ca" :answer-field/choices ["q-72431/selection/f00f7fe4bdb5a1ba69e484be68bc584990708b6a8ecf444a91a92bd3c51168ca" "q-72431/selection/2582eededdce771f69264958a7e9833166b57dd21f6bcfbbb6a702be348acd01" "q-72431/selection/5a205519a39aae2cc2ee3ab2b4f40c05710edef1635521291bff72e38d1d7e67" "q-72431/selection/10deb657ce6245f2c87853d0ba377db6a8c75128c2ca248866674550f0d2e753" "q-72431/selection/4f9a3f596f38256fa2db08c03e11de561715e67db736d93b6847644322cedbfc"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-72431" :question/id #uuid "d7bfa495-1b68-5727-9e29-0eace5070a84" :question/math-academy-id "q-72431" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{4}{(8-x)^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int 4(8-x)^{-5}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=8-x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 4(8-x)^{-5}\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int {u}^{-5}\\cdot (-1)\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =4\\cdot (-1)\\int {u}^{-5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-4\\int {u}^{-5}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-4\\cdot \\frac{1}{(-4)}{u}^{-4}+C \\\\  & =(8-x)^{-4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(8-x)^{4}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{(8-x)^{4}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{(8-x)^{4}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(8-x)^{-4}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =(-4)(8-x)^{-5}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8-x)+0 \\\\  & =(-4)(8-x)^{-5}\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & =4(8-x)^{-5} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{(8-x)^{5}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-72431/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-72431"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517/selection/6f0a2f22377c8633e137563df34be15dc43318bef68efcef571c2bb6fbb726b1" :answer/id #uuid "89259f28-d96f-5e00-9005-829562f4be25" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5(9-5x)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517/selection/fc48b89f6ad649a6f762577e09dc4f79c622730b607c4d4a28596a9ee6257aed" :answer/id #uuid "110e9da5-7e4d-5325-9512-b0772dba01fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2(9-5x)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517/selection/b09e0311d1562959cfcaae070c8c54ed64d4936b514834c67b33c4d55605018b" :answer/id #uuid "958e66aa-520e-5e84-be2e-e1cb143515bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517/selection/656e46750f014406e1b4e634d98a6ea72995bc7ccb09f43f709f280b16939695" :answer/id #uuid "b0462011-84bf-59ae-8649-365326a6d481" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{20(9-5x)^{4}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517/selection/7a8cb8781b7337c5abb9b909d5c72db4e1ad89cb3c8f09eb627981c9b13f1570" :answer/id #uuid "0726c688-5052-50ce-9edd-ad69b0848c48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ccdca3b1-2f84-5f84-8686-232cb799c22e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113517/selection/b09e0311d1562959cfcaae070c8c54ed64d4936b514834c67b33c4d55605018b" :answer-field/choices ["q-113517/selection/6f0a2f22377c8633e137563df34be15dc43318bef68efcef571c2bb6fbb726b1" "q-113517/selection/fc48b89f6ad649a6f762577e09dc4f79c622730b607c4d4a28596a9ee6257aed" "q-113517/selection/b09e0311d1562959cfcaae070c8c54ed64d4936b514834c67b33c4d55605018b" "q-113517/selection/656e46750f014406e1b4e634d98a6ea72995bc7ccb09f43f709f280b16939695" "q-113517/selection/7a8cb8781b7337c5abb9b909d5c72db4e1ad89cb3c8f09eb627981c9b13f1570"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113517" :question/id #uuid "d34fadec-e1db-5f0e-b3fb-64f3326f1376" :question/math-academy-id "q-113517" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{(9-5x)^{3}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (9-5x)^{-3}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=9-5x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (9-5x)^{-3}\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{-3}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\int {u}^{-3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}){u}^{-2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10{u}^{2}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(9-5x)^{-2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot (-2)(9-5x)^{-3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9-5x)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}(9-5x)^{-3}\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =(9-5x)^{-3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{(9-5x)}^{3}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-113517/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113517"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511/selection/f08a223910190091bd8c2e62bb8a0c1cfc99ad7b664008ecca845f5bdc3986e6" :answer/id #uuid "fd9e0721-472b-538e-8482-f7367d5bfdb9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{25(5x-1)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511/selection/3c597488e25210973e5a9d3758a0fd19a3268bc83ec9037f6f4aa0e0a283dedb" :answer/id #uuid "75e282a3-2331-58cb-b900-7f618ed96fc4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{25(5x-1)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511/selection/07007320d0cfd90a97ec515656aecfff575662cf8527424277a0fd731e1b433a" :answer/id #uuid "ef1a4d19-c649-5a42-b37a-a3cedd37dacc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{35(5x-1)^{7}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511/selection/78d388cdd8b096788a79c21595c95a438f68c3f187839364f6e9b999199ee8db" :answer/id #uuid "3d3ec94f-a0c6-53c8-8916-938b8ce1d934" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5(5x-1)^{7}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511/selection/c57fd681ecb8010959cefa7613408851947b5f9ef70de997667d8dc737eb8fe3" :answer/id #uuid "1130df90-df7c-5f76-839c-4a8178a11de0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5(5x-1)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "36c78e2d-d91d-5796-8eb4-d1455c6a7591" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113511/selection/f08a223910190091bd8c2e62bb8a0c1cfc99ad7b664008ecca845f5bdc3986e6" :answer-field/choices ["q-113511/selection/f08a223910190091bd8c2e62bb8a0c1cfc99ad7b664008ecca845f5bdc3986e6" "q-113511/selection/3c597488e25210973e5a9d3758a0fd19a3268bc83ec9037f6f4aa0e0a283dedb" "q-113511/selection/07007320d0cfd90a97ec515656aecfff575662cf8527424277a0fd731e1b433a" "q-113511/selection/78d388cdd8b096788a79c21595c95a438f68c3f187839364f6e9b999199ee8db" "q-113511/selection/c57fd681ecb8010959cefa7613408851947b5f9ef70de997667d8dc737eb8fe3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113511" :question/id #uuid "4ae7beff-7f65-5fd8-9a89-d99b8ffa80b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-113511" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{1}{(5x-1)^{6}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (5x-1)^{-6}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=5x-1.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5x-1)^{-6}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{-6}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int {u}^{-6}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5}){u}^{-5}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{25{u}^{5}}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{25(5x-1)^{5}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{25(5x-1)^{5}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{25(5x-1)^{5}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{25}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(5x-1)^{-5}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{25}\\cdot (-5)\\cdot (5x-1)^{-6}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x-1)+0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5(5x-1)^{6}}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(5x-1)^{6}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-113511/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113511"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512/selection/e53719b62425a94c39ddbcd0c24793af1355437b6c0c7fca60744bb457d7c71b" :answer/id #uuid "8827db20-b595-5791-af13-4ddaaf6bfd7d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{16(2x+3)^{8}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512/selection/d6d84268a37f587c0f3b446bd8e268be3a88fa361c219436c51245dc07f5dcd8" :answer/id #uuid "0adbf264-1352-5ca3-8fc9-1b3771272720" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{12(2x+3)^{6}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512/selection/f61d32f994e4e25a53a1c7219fb622dcc5280dd0dc3a1069567203ff0094ab2e" :answer/id #uuid "4084494f-1e1b-5c69-85d8-c427b5db14c7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2(2x+3)^{8}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512/selection/6ee9c8eec518d3e6c06d99a71de823a7677385c3f8709a6e8b6744d5f175067e" :answer/id #uuid "7360ad74-6fe9-5223-97a8-69c435c43bc8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{6(2x+3)^{6}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512/selection/722e1b0b0cb945f641f516d9e57ffd6c5cee4cda90187a8023160f55baa85f05" :answer/id #uuid "f41518ea-84c4-5d8e-ae72-344931e302ed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{12(2x+3)^{6}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a721bb6b-7934-58b1-8fab-de1e1d92a61e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-113512/selection/722e1b0b0cb945f641f516d9e57ffd6c5cee4cda90187a8023160f55baa85f05" :answer-field/choices ["q-113512/selection/e53719b62425a94c39ddbcd0c24793af1355437b6c0c7fca60744bb457d7c71b" "q-113512/selection/d6d84268a37f587c0f3b446bd8e268be3a88fa361c219436c51245dc07f5dcd8" "q-113512/selection/f61d32f994e4e25a53a1c7219fb622dcc5280dd0dc3a1069567203ff0094ab2e" "q-113512/selection/6ee9c8eec518d3e6c06d99a71de823a7677385c3f8709a6e8b6744d5f175067e" "q-113512/selection/722e1b0b0cb945f641f516d9e57ffd6c5cee4cda90187a8023160f55baa85f05"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-113512" :question/id #uuid "bdd59737-ae15-573f-9634-0d492e32540a" :question/math-academy-id "q-113512" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int \\frac{1}{(2x+3)^{7}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (2x+3)^{-7}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nLet $u=2x+3.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (2x+3)^{-7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{-7}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int {u}^{-7}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{6}){u}^{-6}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12{u}^{6}}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12(2x+3)^{6}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{12(2x+3)^{6}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{1}{12(2x+3)^{6}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(2x+3)^{-6}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{12}\\cdot (-6)\\cdot (2x+3)^{-7}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x+3)+0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2(2x+3)^{7}}\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(2x+3)^{7}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-113512/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "387d85df-b839-5837-89b9-5e4bb4daa073"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-113512"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393/selection/bc986a952e342e2b0cc8138d3b9829810e29672f810c146eb94b3adfea754b36" :answer/id #uuid "88937ad0-3ec1-5048-913e-a8fe44545a9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3\\sqrt[4]{1-5s}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393/selection/d24a93ddd559362b934d28588218622586033e4be07cf365f6961a725fefa2da" :answer/id #uuid "f991f033-2887-5df7-b463-f1e0d7646b9a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{3-5s}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393/selection/6b134119d8f6bc7c161dfb54a4912e5c81efb3777ee388419339e700b436adc6" :answer/id #uuid "041652d2-599f-5a59-bde6-5a1c1b0b808e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{7}\\sqrt[3]{3-5s}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393/selection/359fd26fda98d5b83d2ba605eddc28fcbd9daba9901742c39421d5d71b3b186d" :answer/id #uuid "ea7d49c9-4759-5795-8740-a64336576900" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5}\\sqrt[3]{3-5s}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393/selection/b638ba5651fe11effce65a2bf96c0b726df93e49c82d95c90ef7ea92d65445fa" :answer/id #uuid "d3b86588-d1c5-57a3-8324-3b7fdc7643f3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{3-5s}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "57925569-9f2a-5c3b-9372-ee2440557bd7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49393/selection/359fd26fda98d5b83d2ba605eddc28fcbd9daba9901742c39421d5d71b3b186d" :answer-field/choices ["q-49393/selection/bc986a952e342e2b0cc8138d3b9829810e29672f810c146eb94b3adfea754b36" "q-49393/selection/d24a93ddd559362b934d28588218622586033e4be07cf365f6961a725fefa2da" "q-49393/selection/6b134119d8f6bc7c161dfb54a4912e5c81efb3777ee388419339e700b436adc6" "q-49393/selection/359fd26fda98d5b83d2ba605eddc28fcbd9daba9901742c39421d5d71b3b186d" "q-49393/selection/b638ba5651fe11effce65a2bf96c0b726df93e49c82d95c90ef7ea92d65445fa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49393" :question/id #uuid "4273b028-6380-56df-90b6-0dc14e74ee2e" :question/math-academy-id "q-49393" :question/problem "$\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{(3-5s)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}s=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (3-5s)^{-2/3}\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nNow, we let  $u=3-5s.$ Then differentiating with respect to $s$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}s}=-5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}s=-\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3-5s)^{-2/3}\\,\\text{d}s & =\\int {u}^{-2/3}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\int {u}^{-2/3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{1/3}{u}^{1/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}{u}^{1/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}(3-5s)^{1/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}\\sqrt[3]{3-5s}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}[-\\frac{3}{5}\\sqrt[3]{3-5s}+C] & =-\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}[\\sqrt[3]{3-5s}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}[(3-5s)^{1/3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{5}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}(3-5s)^{-2/3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}s}(3-5s)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}(3-5s)^{-2/3}\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =(3-5s)^{-2/3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt[3]{(3-5s)^{2}}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-49393/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49393"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498/selection/f364c5a6b917aad2468a1076e23f116803b4ea51e48b1c12f00d04a43641cdb1" :answer/id #uuid "1cd51266-2143-558a-b3b1-b5f1332b1305" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498/selection/adada5060d3e1080df33d9eb02d8afd45975c004a0160acc07d2e95bc9e69111" :answer/id #uuid "4ddd09ed-859e-5506-bb5a-b3d8d30518cc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{5x+1}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498/selection/8ea4a9c87c6ee3ba2eabe7eb1a39cd63223bb25b2a1b696924fc3b941d00d1a7" :answer/id #uuid "ca277357-5421-5c57-96d4-bedc46d2f129" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\sqrt{5x+1}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498/selection/8851ab7556ff0cfb5d1e16dd5a6129b45e02030c5fa6218acad90fad2a892da1" :answer/id #uuid "0236b725-105a-51b3-aa66-6629019d32a8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498/selection/d209e698c776e7654a61925fb4e7dbbf34a65043a0a666048b5852cbf3ab6be6" :answer/id #uuid "1356d90a-4d36-5738-a84e-51683ecaa86c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{2}{15}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "50bbb8e2-65a8-533f-9ee1-15004c873ce2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-12498/selection/d209e698c776e7654a61925fb4e7dbbf34a65043a0a666048b5852cbf3ab6be6" :answer-field/choices ["q-12498/selection/f364c5a6b917aad2468a1076e23f116803b4ea51e48b1c12f00d04a43641cdb1" "q-12498/selection/adada5060d3e1080df33d9eb02d8afd45975c004a0160acc07d2e95bc9e69111" "q-12498/selection/8ea4a9c87c6ee3ba2eabe7eb1a39cd63223bb25b2a1b696924fc3b941d00d1a7" "q-12498/selection/8851ab7556ff0cfb5d1e16dd5a6129b45e02030c5fa6218acad90fad2a892da1" "q-12498/selection/d209e698c776e7654a61925fb4e7dbbf34a65043a0a666048b5852cbf3ab6be6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-12498" :question/id #uuid "457b9ae0-36a8-577c-85ad-8057dc66fc9a" :question/math-academy-id "q-12498" :question/problem "$\\int \\sqrt{5x+1}\\,\\text{d}x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (5x+1)^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we let $u=5x+1.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=5\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{5}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (5x+1)^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{1/2}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\int {u}^{1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3}{u}^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}{u}^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}(5x+1)^{3/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{2}{15}\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}+C] & =\\frac{2}{15}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\sqrt{(5x+1)^{3}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(5x+1)^{3/2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{15}\\cdot \\frac{3}{2}(5x+1)^{1/2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5x+1)+0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}(5x+1)^{1/2}\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =(5x+1)^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{5x+1}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-12498/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-12498"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-49391"] :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (4y-1)^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$\n\nNow, we let $u=4y-1.$ Then differentiating with respect to $y$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}y}=4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}y=\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (4y-1)^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}y & =\\int {u}^{-1/2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\int {u}^{-1/2}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{(1/2)}{u}^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{4}\\cdot {u}^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}(4y-1)^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{4y-1}}{2}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[\\frac{\\sqrt{4y-1}}{2}+C] & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[\\sqrt{4y-1}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}[(4y-1)^{1/2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(4y-1)^{-1/2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}y}(4y-1)+0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4}(4y-1)^{-1/2}\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4y-1}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439/selection/6b848d3aa968c50eb063907d0f140b6223bbfaf655610faf36d4c72c137e6c72" :answer/id #uuid "9c6e8082-7b80-51ac-9c78-f7c8cc246f61" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439/selection/c145fdb24ecb42784db713a129063e4c421b65db9b62ddf124f578b3913e3052" :answer/id #uuid "8e6a96a9-9b9b-5cba-9a65-3490ba742380" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439/selection/d448715a3e7003bc8c650fcda64c17c16a37da4802f2a7b1a5c8cc1b08742700" :answer/id #uuid "a1a4ed23-2b46-5648-850c-91c8d7211a8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{9}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439/selection/6af968862cd0db87d034c8bd8a089a62100664ee29ad7f6bfc426f5a93c7a9df" :answer/id #uuid "6974fcbd-fc66-5d4d-8798-2dc3ffbd4389" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{11}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439/selection/ec38b0c5baa6ee7873e32107029003fcdf7ddf65720270e96afe5bb35c9e7122" :answer/id #uuid "55a4f1f0-0762-5f16-a317-ca6180888bf8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{4}{9}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{9}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "afb0006f-3f23-56ee-88f7-28fbc4472d13" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-49439/selection/6af968862cd0db87d034c8bd8a089a62100664ee29ad7f6bfc426f5a93c7a9df" :answer-field/choices ["q-49439/selection/6b848d3aa968c50eb063907d0f140b6223bbfaf655610faf36d4c72c137e6c72" "q-49439/selection/c145fdb24ecb42784db713a129063e4c421b65db9b62ddf124f578b3913e3052" "q-49439/selection/d448715a3e7003bc8c650fcda64c17c16a37da4802f2a7b1a5c8cc1b08742700" "q-49439/selection/6af968862cd0db87d034c8bd8a089a62100664ee29ad7f6bfc426f5a93c7a9df" "q-49439/selection/ec38b0c5baa6ee7873e32107029003fcdf7ddf65720270e96afe5bb35c9e7122"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-49439" :question/id #uuid "61d8dd43-99c6-5162-9111-9fc96bb88dcd" :question/math-academy-id "q-49439" :question/problem "Calculate the integral $\\int \\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{7}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (x-100)^{7/4}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we let  $u=x-100.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=1\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (x-100)^{7/4}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{7/4}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{{u}^{11/4}}{11/4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}(x-100)^{11/4}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{4}{11}\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}+C] & =\\frac{4}{11}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{11}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(x-100)^{11/4}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{11}\\cdot \\frac{11}{4}(x-100)^{7/4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x-100)+0 \\\\  & =(x-100)^{7/4}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =\\sqrt[4]{(x-100)^{7}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-49439/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-49439"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019/selection/8b84b467de765a41a15e3dc229703faeebdf901701d2183be5ef6247d42ebd6b" :answer/id #uuid "bb4a1436-d46b-5256-a88f-1c4ecc99fa91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{20}\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019/selection/7cf3e3500ed4c2fed1fbc955ba8c795ae55bc96e92d03777f5a5d8e837881487" :answer/id #uuid "bae468b8-a0be-5f43-8752-0da783a87487" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{20}\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019/selection/a6214783c312bfc3c73c4e44b5c83f77ccb6d63da3624914228a20bab69d07c1" :answer/id #uuid "987cbf2f-7fa9-5128-b1f4-43d94fa392bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3}{5}\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019/selection/da5fd2144c4004374f781a7da3c83b1ab35dafc378fca00bb7c2aaa51c00d814" :answer/id #uuid "9d85911a-7b92-50f7-90f7-32793bcd92bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{2}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019/selection/f8421ebd3e5551178531b74b088f508f6a0dd687f2dd4269a5066f5769dc9a45" :answer/id #uuid "2d3629dc-e170-57de-9d13-daace66ab579" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{5}\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{5}}+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "023632fb-f67b-5aeb-992d-21184bbbe8b3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-17019/selection/7cf3e3500ed4c2fed1fbc955ba8c795ae55bc96e92d03777f5a5d8e837881487" :answer-field/choices ["q-17019/selection/8b84b467de765a41a15e3dc229703faeebdf901701d2183be5ef6247d42ebd6b" "q-17019/selection/7cf3e3500ed4c2fed1fbc955ba8c795ae55bc96e92d03777f5a5d8e837881487" "q-17019/selection/a6214783c312bfc3c73c4e44b5c83f77ccb6d63da3624914228a20bab69d07c1" "q-17019/selection/da5fd2144c4004374f781a7da3c83b1ab35dafc378fca00bb7c2aaa51c00d814" "q-17019/selection/f8421ebd3e5551178531b74b088f508f6a0dd687f2dd4269a5066f5769dc9a45"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-17019" :question/id #uuid "b0627661-1702-5ba3-b036-6efedf7ba0f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-17019" :question/problem "Calculate the integral\n$\\int \\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we rewrite the integral as\n\n$$\n\\int (3-4x)^{2/3}\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nNow, we let  $u=3-4x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-4\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{4}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $u$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (3-4x)^{2/3}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{2/3}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\int {u}^{2/3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5/3}{u}^{5/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot \\frac{3}{5}{u}^{5/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{20}{u}^{5/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{20}(3-4x)^{5/3}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{20}\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{5}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-\\frac{3}{20}(3-4x)^{5/3}+C] & =-\\frac{3}{20}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(3-4x)^{5/3}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{3}{20}\\cdot \\frac{5}{3}(3-4x)^{2/3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3-4x)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{4}(3-4x)^{3/2}\\cdot (-4) \\\\  & =(3-4x)^{3/2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{(3-4x)^{2}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-17019/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0ae5760b-9277-596c-8546-dca4fd985bd7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-17019"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
